/E (The previous suggests that within this model, we may have net transmitters: disproportionally generating international uncertainty; neutral nodes: receiving and re-emitting uncertainty without any particular amplification effect; and net receivers: experiencing the greatest effects of foreign uncertainty. Within the world city network, uncertainty spreads in proportion to the directional connectivity of one city to others. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
